{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-9-1","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：平面与平方与整数","englishTitle":"If two similar plane numbers by multiplying one another make some number, the product will be square.","book":9,"number":1,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.1","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.1/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":1,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-9-1@raw-3654e45ae2c31c9a","contentId":"euclid-9-1","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3654e45ae2c31c9ab7f0562df972d000cbac18907b746cd1cfafc5075ba36e76","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-9-1.statement","euclid-9-1.construction.1","euclid-9-1.construction.2","euclid-9-1.proof.1","euclid-9-1.proof.2","euclid-9-1.proof.3","euclid-9-1.proof.4","euclid-9-1.conclusion","euclid-9-1.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-9-1.statement","contentId":"euclid-9-1","revisionId":"euclid-9-1@raw-3654e45ae2c31c9a","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"86d5fe3313ff81f43329c6beb052dd6a10c96294f2fd730f323897f09f8fb675","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If two similar plane numbers by multiplying one another make some number, the product will be square."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两个相似平面数乘以一个数字 产品将是平方数"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-1.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-9-1","revisionId":"euclid-9-1@raw-3654e45ae2c31c9a","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e585471cf2dfb4b1a7d70b95019a0d06c11bb3c630564db4a9b17eb80cdc411a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A, B be two similar plane numbers, and let A by multiplying B make C; I say that C is square."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A,B是2 相似平面数,让A和B的产物是C;我说C是平方数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-1.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-9-1","revisionId":"euclid-9-1@raw-3654e45ae2c31c9a","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7a9ccbe4b2f4e21faed7c448f2cf00c3fc6c75b991cd5847720709a193ed0086","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let A by multiplying itself make D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A乘以乘以D,就等于D"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-1.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-9-1","revisionId":"euclid-9-1@raw-3654e45ae2c31c9a","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"593ff9891e474ca9fc7c6f98ac0863fe137b70b0ef2b3f5af464d55584e24a39","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore D is square."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"所以D是平方数"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-1.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-9-1","revisionId":"euclid-9-1@raw-3654e45ae2c31c9a","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"963ab736bc9787204315ab097f50463079fdabbefb2cf5c14fa9413b121f32ef","citations":["euclid-7-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then A by multiplying itself has made D, and by multiplying B has made C, therefore, as A is to B, so is D to C. [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从那时起,A乘以D,乘以B,C,A比B等于D比C；A 与 B 之比等于 D 与 C 之比。 [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-1.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-9-1","revisionId":"euclid-9-1@raw-3654e45ae2c31c9a","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"dce4ccc5154189bf969eb065b24559e6fbd5ae76cd45a6ff552daef9fd1faa39","citations":["euclid-8-18"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since A, B are similar plane numbers, therefore one mean proportional number falls between A, B. [[VIII. 18](/principles/euclid-8-18)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A,B是相似平面数, 所以一个比例中项数字在A,B之间。 [[VIII. 18](/principles/euclid-8-18)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-1.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-9-1","revisionId":"euclid-9-1@raw-3654e45ae2c31c9a","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a8b399e4d2ce27f18b5c4ab4eaae6df1b509f12635043f701a913c5d35f3b1bb","citations":["euclid-8-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, if numbers fall between two numbers in continued proportion, as many as fall between them, so many also fall between those which have the same ratio; [[VIII. 8](/principles/euclid-8-8)] so that one mean proportional number falls between D, C also."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,如果数字在连比例的2个数字之间下降,那么,在连比例的2个数字之间下降,那么,在比例中项的数字中,也有如此多的数字在下降,在D和C之间下降。 [[VIII. 8](/principles/euclid-8-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-1.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-9-1","revisionId":"euclid-9-1@raw-3654e45ae2c31c9a","order":7,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8ef288d31615a61d7863e3f780881ea6998e690f5f4c48f67564aad31de62350","citations":["euclid-8-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And D is square; therefore C is also square. [[VIII. 22](/principles/euclid-8-22)] Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"D是平方数,C也是平方数,Q,E,D。 [[VIII. 22](/principles/euclid-8-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-1.source","contentId":"euclid-9-1","revisionId":"euclid-9-1@raw-3654e45ae2c31c9a","order":8,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"80149ba40d901ba4780b4982dbc66a13e8362e5153f5883260aa782a414f2ea6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.1/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.1\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-9-1:euclid-7-17:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-9-1","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-9-1.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-17","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.1","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.1/","sourceLabel":"VII. 17"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-9-1:euclid-8-18:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-9-1","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-9-1.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-8-18","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.1","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.1/","sourceLabel":"VIII. 18"}},{"id